---
args: {"desk": "ReuseDesk", "prior": "MaterialProfile[]"}
returns: "MaterialProfile[]"
---
For each supplied offer and changed material event call distinguishMaterialEvidence(offer, desk.materialEvents). Separate verified properties from seller assumptions, quantities from qualitative descriptions, and custody from transferable title. Preserve owner restrictions and withdrawn offers. An unknown maintenance history remains unknown operability; a product name cannot establish food-contact, structural or other consequential suitability.
